        "Id1": {
            "text": "Pennsylvania's Franklin County is found to the west of Adams County, Pennsylvania and Cumberland County, Pennsylvania is found to the north. The 11th Mississippi Infantry Monument, erected in 2000 in Adams County, is categorised as a contributing property."
        },
        "Id2": {
            "text": "The 11th Mississippi Infantry Monument, established in the year 2000, falls under the category of contributing property and is located in Adams County Pennsylvania which is East of Franklin County, Pennsylvania. Adams County also has Cumberland County, Pennsylvania to its north."
        },
